{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-econometrics","title":"高级计量经济学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics","introMarkdown":"# 高级计量经济学 简介\n\n高级计量经济学是经济学研究生最核心的方法论课程之一，它提供从数据中识别因果关系、估计经济模型参数和检验理论假说的系统性工具。扎实的计量训练是阅读前沿经济学文献和开展独立实证研究的基本前提。\n\n本课程从经典回归理论的深化出发，延伸到时间序列分析和微观计量方法，最终聚焦于当代最受关注的因果推断技术，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**计量经济学基础深化**回顾并扩展 OLS 方法的理论基础，引入工具变量法处理内生性问题，并系统讲解面板数据模型的固定效应和随机效应估计。这些是绝大多数应用经济学论文的方法论起点。\n\n第二章**时间序列分析**覆盖宏观经济研究中最常用的动态建模技术。ARIMA 模型处理单一序列的预测问题，协整与误差修正模型分析变量间的长期均衡关系，VAR 模型则提供多变量系统的联合建模框架。\n\n第三章**微观计量方法**聚焦于因变量为非连续型时的估计策略。离散选择模型处理二元和多元选择行为，处理效应估计解决政策评估中的选择偏差问题，样本选择模型纠正非随机样本导致的估计偏误。\n\n第四章**因果推断方法**介绍近二十年来在应用经济学中占据核心地位的准实验方法。双重差分法、断点回归设计和合成控制法各有独特的识别策略，它们使研究者能够在观察数据中逼近随机实验的因果推断效果。\n\n建议学习者按顺序推进，在每个章节中配合经典论文的复现练习来巩固方法掌握。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"计量经济学基础深化","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ols-assumptions","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — OLS 经典假设","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/foundations/ols-assumptions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"instrumental-variables","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 工具变量法","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/foundations/instrumental-variables"},{"seq":3,"slug":"panel-data-models","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 面板数据模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/foundations/panel-data-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-series","title":"时间序列分析","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/time-series","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"arima-models","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — ARIMA 模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/time-series/arima-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cointegration-ecm","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 协整与误差修正","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/time-series/cointegration-ecm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"var-models","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — VAR 模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/time-series/var-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"microeconometrics","title":"微观计量方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/microeconometrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"discrete-choice-models","title":"研究生经济学 — 离散选择模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/microeconometrics/discrete-choice-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"treatment-effects","title":"研究生经济学 — 处理效应估计","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/microeconometrics/treatment-effects"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sample-selection","title":"研究生经济学 — 样本选择模型","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/microeconometrics/sample-selection"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"causal-inference","title":"因果推断方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/causal-inference","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diff-in-diff","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 双重差分法","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/causal-inference/diff-in-diff"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regression-discontinuity","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 断点回归设计","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/causal-inference/regression-discontinuity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"synthetic-control","title":"研究生 高级计量经济学 — 合成控制法","url":"/education/graduate/economics/advanced-econometrics/causal-inference/synthetic-control"}]}]}